#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_eh_credit_override_log__exposure_at_override
msgid ""
"Partner exposure (open AR plus drafts when policy says so) at the moment of "
"override."
msgstr "覆寫當下的合作夥伴曝險（未結 AR 加上政策要求時的草稿）。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_res_partner__eh_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_res_users__eh_credit_limit
msgid ""
"Per-partner credit limit override. Zero means use the company default "
"policy. Negative values are not allowed."
msgstr "按業務夥伴的信用額度覆寫值。零表示使用公司預設政策。不允許負值。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_res_partner__eh_effective_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_res_users__eh_effective_credit_limit
msgid ""
"Per-partner override if set, else the company default policy's "
"default_credit_limit. Zero means no enforcement. Expressed in the company "
"currency to match exposure."
msgstr ""
"如已設定則採用按業務夥伴的覆寫值，否則採用公司預設政策的 default_credit_limit。零表示不強制執行。以公司貨幣表示以匹配曝險。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_res_partner__eh_credit_policy_id
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_res_users__eh_credit_policy_id
msgid ""
"Per-partner policy override. When set, takes precedence over the company "
"default. Useful for known-risk customers that need stricter enforcement than"
" the default policy applies."
msgstr "按業務夥伴的政策覆寫值。設定後優先於公司預設值。適用於需要比預設政策更嚴格執行的已知風險客戶。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_account_credit_limit/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Posting %(partner)s over its credit limit requires an override by a member "
"of %(group)s. Configure the override group on the credit policy, or have an "
"authorised user post this invoice."
msgstr ""
"過帳 %(partner)s 超出其信用額度需要 %(group)s 成員的越權批准。請在信用政策中設定越權群組，或由授權使用者過帳此發票。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_account_credit_limit/models/account_move.py:0
msgid ""
"Posting brings %(partner)s to %(new).2f, over the %(limit).2f credit limit "
"(excess %(excess).2f)."
msgstr "過帳使 %(partner)s 達到 %(new).2f，超出 %(limit).2f 的信用額度（超額 %(excess).2f）。"

