msgstr "僅警告"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_account_credit_limit.selection__eh_credit_policy__enforcement_mode__warn
msgid "Warn only"
msgstr "僅警告"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_eh_credit_policy__enforcement_mode
msgid ""
"Warn-only logs the breach to the move's chatter but does not block the post."
" Block raises a UserError unless an override has been recorded on the move."
msgstr "僅警告會將違規記錄到分錄的討論欄，但不會阻止過帳。阻止將引發 UserError，除非分錄上已記錄了覆寫。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:eh_account_credit_limit.selection__res_partner__eh_credit_status__warn
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "警告"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:eh_account_credit_limit.field_eh_credit_policy__website_message_ids
msgid "Website Messages"
msgstr "網站資訊"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_eh_credit_policy__website_message_ids
msgid "Website communication history"
msgstr "網站溝通記錄"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_eh_credit_policy__include_drafts
msgid ""
"When set, draft customer invoices count toward a partner's exposure "
"alongside posted-and-unpaid invoices. Useful in shops where sales and "
"accounting are different cohorts and drafts are a real commitment. Default "
"off so the gate only considers what is posted."
msgstr ""
"設定後，客戶發票草稿將與已過帳且未付的發票一起計入合作夥伴的曝險。適用於銷售與會計屬不同群體且草稿構成真實承諾的門市。預設關閉，使門檻僅考量已過帳的部分。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_eh_credit_policy__include_sale_orders
msgid ""
"When set, the not-yet-invoiced portion of confirmed sales orders counts "
"toward a partner's exposure. Catches credit risk earlier than waiting for "
"the invoice: a customer with a 100k confirmed order but only 20k invoiced "
"has 80k of real future receivables, and a strict gate should refuse a fresh "
"order that pushes total commitments past the limit. Has no effect when the "
"sale module is not installed."
msgstr ""
"設定後，已確認銷售訂單中尚未開票的部分將計入合作夥伴的曝險。它比等待發票更早地捕捉信用風險：某客戶有一筆 100k 的已確認訂單但僅開票 20k，則有 "
"80k 的真實未來應收帳款，嚴格的門檻應拒絕一筆會使總承諾超過限額的新訂單。當未安裝銷售模組時無效。"

#. module: eh_account_credit_limit
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_credit_limit.field_eh_credit_policy__is_company_default
msgid ""
"When set, this policy is the company-level default for partners that do not "
"define their own override. Only one company-default policy may exist per "
"company; the constraint enforces this."
msgstr "設定後，此策略是公司層級的預設策略，適用於未定義自身覆蓋的合作夥伴。每家公司只能存在一個公司預設策略；約束會強制執行這一點。"

